  "title": "Chef John's Chocolate Lava Cake",
  "description": "This chocolate lava cake recipe makes 4 individual molten chocolate desserts with gooey, oozing centers perfect for chocolate lovers in your life!",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
